killsuru (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Multi-OS support: prefix-independent layout (bin/, share/), the helper
    locates its data relative to itself.
  * New `killsuru init' subcommand and install.sh per-user installer for
    Linux, macOS, *BSD, WSL and Git Bash.
  * Colorize with plain ANSI escapes instead of tput (drops the ncurses-bin
    recommendation); honour NO_COLOR.
  * PowerShell support (Windows PowerShell 5.1 / PowerShell 7+): killsuru.ps1
    hook and install.ps1 installer (not shipped in the .deb).

 -- Akira Morooka <0825araakimoro@gmail.com>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0900

killsuru (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix install URL in README (releases/tag/ → releases/download/).
  * Add zsh -n to make check syntax validation.
  * Guard postrm temp file with trap on failure.

 -- Akira Morooka <0825araakimoro@gmail.com>  Tue, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0900

killsuru (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * kill() wrapper for bash and zsh, enabled system-wide for interactive
    shells via /etc/profile.d, /etc/bash.bashrc and /etc/zsh/zshrc.
  * killsuru(1) helper command to render the SUSURUTV ASCII art, with
    per-user override and color support.

 -- Akira Morooka <0825araakimoro@gmail.com>  Wed, 17 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0900
